```javascript
tokenizer.stemTokens();
```

#### Part-Of-Speech Tagging

Tag each word according to its part of speech:
```javascript
tokenizer.taggedWords();
```

### Step 4: Classifying Tweets

Now, let's write some code to classify tweets based on their sentiment.

#### Main Function

Define a function to handle the classification process:
```javascript
function classifyTweet(tweetText) {
  const classifier = new TweetClassifier({
    // Replace with your own configuration
  });

  // Tokenize the tweet text
  const tokens = tokenizer.tokenize(tweetText);

  // Stem the tokens
  const stemmedTokens = tokenizer.stemTokens(tokens);

  // Tag each word according to its part of speech
